WEBVTT

00:15:00.036 --> 00:15:02.196
It's in the arch
of your best friend's eyebrow

00:15:02.196 --> 00:15:03.676
when she makes a joke.

00:15:03.676 --> 00:15:06.516
It's in the smallpox vaccines
and the Golden Gate bridges

00:15:06.556 --> 00:15:08.476
that humans somehow managed to invent

00:15:08.516 --> 00:15:10.876
against all odds.

00:15:10.876 --> 00:15:13.236
It's in the surge of love
you feel for a cellist

00:15:13.276 --> 00:15:14.996
who did a brave and miraculous thing

00:15:15.036 --> 00:15:17.556
during a misbegotten war in 1992.

00:15:21.476 --> 00:15:24.116
And it's right here in this room.

00:15:24.116 --> 00:15:26.876
Follow your longing
where it’s telling you to go,

00:15:26.876 --> 00:15:30.676
and may it carry you
straight to the beating heart